---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Cybex Precision Gunworx privacy policy. How we collect, use, and protect your personal information.">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Privacy Policy</span></div>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Last updated: September 2026</p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you place an order or contact us, we may collect your name, email address, phone number, shipping address, and payment information. This information is necessary to process orders and communicate with you.</p>

        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Process and fulfill orders</li>
          <li>Communicate about order status</li>
          <li>Respond to inquiries and support requests</li>
          <li>Comply with legal requirements (e.g., ATF records for firearms transfers)</li>
          <li>Improve our products and services</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Payment Security</h2>
        <p>Payment processing is handled by Snipcart's secure payment gateway. We do not store credit card numbers on our servers. All transactions are encrypted using industry-standard SSL/TLS.</p>

        <h2>Third-Party Sharing</h2>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share information only with shipping carriers (to deliver your order) and payment processors (to complete transactions).</p>

        <h2>ATF & Legal Compliance</h2>
        <p>We are required by federal law to maintain records of all firearms transactions. These records are kept in accordance with ATF regulations and are not shared except as required by law.</p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>Our website uses cookies for shopping cart functionality (via Snipcart) and basic analytics. You can disable cookies in your browser settings, but this may affect shopping cart functionality.</p>

        <h2>Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You may request to view, update, or delete your personal information by contacting us at <a href="mailto:sales@cybexprecisiongunworx.com">sales@cybexprecisiongunworx.com</a>. Note that certain records must be retained per legal requirements.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy-related questions, email <a href="mailto:sales@cybexprecisiongunworx.com">sales@cybexprecisiongunworx.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+14193508484">(419) 350-8484</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
